    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's easy to say that, but it's not true. the person i was... that person is gone. the world doesn't see me, they see a caricature. a villain. there's no coming back from this. it feels like i'm just occupying space in a body that doesn't belong to me anymore. it's like i'm already just a shadow.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
